OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council boss had incentive to
OL,4,Adelete emails over perception she 'was
OL,5,Atoo close to DUP,' court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former chief executive of Mid and
OL,8,FEast Antrim Council had an incentive to
OL,9,Fillegally delete emails "because of the
OL,10,Fperception that she was too close to
OL,11,FDUP politicians", a court has been
OL,12,Ftold.
OL,14,FAnne Donaghy, 56, of Clonmore Road in
OL,15,FDungannon denies three charges.
OL,17,FShe is accused of deleting or
OL,18,Fattempting to delete an email in
OL,19,Fcontravention of the Freedom of
OL,20,FInformation (FoI) Act and also aiding
OL,21,Fand abetting another person to do so.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
