OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council boss had incentive to
OL,4,Adelete emails over perception she 'was
OL,5,Atoo close to DUP,' court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe emails were sent to Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party (DUP) politicians Arlene
OL,9,FFoster and Gregg McKeen, forwarding on
OL,10,Fa letter Donaghy had sent to senior
OL,11,Fcivil servants in London raising
OL,12,Fconcerns about the safety of staff
OL,13,Fcarrying out post-Brexit checks at
OL,14,FLarne Port.
